ge/upload/t_thumb/sc143ta.jpg"}, {"id": 1871178, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc143t6.jpg"}], "slug": "spirimonz", "storyline": "Spirimonz is a paranormal investigation game in which you explore a small town in third-person view (TPS) and choose which haunted house will become your next mission. Each investigation then takes place in first-person view (FPS), where you must gather clues and identify the evil spirit haunting the location.\n\nTo solve each case, search for evidence, study paranormal activity, and make use of your Spirimonz companions. Up to five companions can accompany you at the same time, each offering unique abilities that help you progress through investigations and uncover the identity of the spirit.\n\nOnce you have gathered enough clues and are confident in your conclusion, you can attempt to capture the spirit. A successful capture will transform the creature into a new Spirimonz that can join your collection and help you tackle future investigations.", "summary": "Spirimonz is a game in which you hunt down evil spirits and capture various ghostly companions who will help you and follow you on every new mission.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/spirimonz", "videos": [{"id": 189124, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IAEvwtp9ULs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IAEvwtp9ULs", "title": "Spirimonz Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IAEvwtp9ULs/uhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189125, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "odZhYr-b-jE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odZhYr-b-jE", "title": "Spirimonz : Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/odZhYr-b-jE/uhddefault.jpg"}]}